comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T10:04:08.397Z",codex-agent,"Plan: author this package own thin caller, pin workflow SHA and pm-github to 2026.10.13, and verify isolated npm/Bun release gates without changing thresholds. Remove fast-glob and any jscpd4 alias; pin pm-ops 2026.10.14. Published changelog reviewed: attestation alias/function rejection, read-only pack prepare, release repair and Windows proof support. Duplication now uses Node glob with jscpd 5. No workflow dispatch, bot requests, merges, or source function changes."
  "2026-10-14T10:07:02.531Z",codex-agent,"Audit before: full 4 vulnerabilities (4 high), production 0. After: full 0, production 0; npm ls braces is empty. The caller runs at 17 1 * * * UTC. It validates access, previews the complete plan, imports with --gate, verifies repeat-import idempotency and privacy, then checks strict health before commit/push/PR. SHA pin matches published pm-github 2026.10.13. Actionlint skipped: binary missing and offline npx registry metadata unavailable. GitHub Actions PR-creation setting verified enabled. No direct fast-glob imports in authored scripts. The package prepare contract will be checked independently."
  "2026-10-14T11:14:45.978Z",codex-agent,"Validation complete: npm: 79/79 tests passed, 0 skipped (test runs: 78 + 1); bun: 79/79 tests passed, 0 skipped (test runs: 78 + 1). Both isolated release:check gates passed at unchanged thresholds. Full audit 0, production audit 0, npm ls braces empty. Caller identity check reports only unbraind/pm-github. Behavioural revert proof: not applicable to workflow-only maintenance; no authored runtime function changed. Changelog regenerated and checked. Actionlint unavailable offline as recorded above. Item stays in progress for orchestrator verification."
